4:["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 py-10","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-dim","children":["агент"," · ","агент + скил"]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-2 font-display text-[clamp(22px,4vw,34px)] font-normal","children":"bff-pipeline-bff"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-ink-dim","children":"BFF-часть пайплайна bff-pipeline-v2: этапы 0–4 (preflight → schema → datasource → resolver → e2e) через детерминированный Node.js runner. Используй для создания .gql схемы, DataSource и резолвера в bff-mls/bff-admin с e2e-проверкой.\\n\\nExamples:\\n<example>\\nuser: \\\"добавь query demoListing в bff-mls под ключ\\\"\\nassistant: \\\"Запускаю агента bff-pipeline-bff для этапов 0–4 пайплайна\\\"\\n<commentary>Новая GraphQL операция на стороне BFF — этапы 0–4.</commentary></example>\\n<example>\\nuser: \\\"прокинь эндпоинт pricing в bff-admin\\\"\\nassistant: \\\"Запускаю агента bff-pipeline-bff для схемы, datasource и резолвера с e2e\\\"\\n<commentary>Новый DataSource + resolver в BFF — этапы 0–4.</commentary></example>"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-2 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-dim","children":"Установка"}],["$","$Lf",null,{"command":"npx skills add egor1991egorovmac-eng/ai-agents-and-skills -g --skill bff-pipeline-bff"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-ink-dim","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/egor1991egorovmac-eng/ai-agents-and-skills/blob/main/skills/bff-pipeline-bff/SKILL.md","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","className":"text-cyan hover:underline","children":"исходник на GitHub →"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"skills/bff-pipeline-bff/SKILL.md"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 border-t border-white/20 pt-2","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",